**Cadence implementation.** The §3.2 cadence table
(two base cadences plus event-driven tightenings)
is implemented as **two jobs plus supervised
checks**:

| Interval / condition | Cadence | Performed by |
|---|---|---|
| Open → +2 h | The gate's V-sets (≈ +10, ≈ +25 min) count as the window's first checks; then +1 h, +2 h | V-sets: the Stage-2 executor in session; +1 h/+2 h: the hourly job |
| +2 h → +12 h | Hourly | Hourly job |
| +12 h → +72 h | Every 6 h | 6-hourly job (handoff, below) |
| On W-1p | Every 10 min until a pass is observed, the value resolves as future (→ W-1f), or 2 h elapse without a pass (→ W-4) | **Supervised** in-session checks by Wren |
